        {
          "category": "structure",
          "statement": "Escalating police encounters, surreal bosses and a hidden-ending path give the apparent sandbox a loose progression toward a finale rather than an endless simulation loop.",
          "sentiment": "neutral",
          "recurrence": "limited",
